{
    "word": "ragbag",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "b7a56a88-db37-3dea-a464-2cf201cd6354",
                "word": "ragbag",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "47a4a862-f2e3-444b-a434-09ba2e9120ac",
                        "entry_id": "b7a56a88-db37-3dea-a464-2cf201cd6354",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "ragbags"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ec03c308-754f-3105-a629-bfc811c82c21",
                        "entry_id": "b7a56a88-db37-3dea-a464-2cf201cd6354",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A bag of rags and scraps."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2684281f-4705-3628-9617-5b26e59631e6",
                        "entry_id": "b7a56a88-db37-3dea-a464-2cf201cd6354",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A collection containing a variety of miscellaneous things; a smorgasbord."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2e285b19-abac-4621-9b91-0f5822ab9067",
                                "sense_id": "2684281f-4705-3628-9617-5b26e59631e6",
                                "text": "The pages that constitute \"Anna Livia Plurabelle\" are surely the most easily decipherable in that masterly and monstrous ragbag of a book."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c44bdde1-30b9-4f55-aaf7-4576b1de3981",
                                "sense_id": "2684281f-4705-3628-9617-5b26e59631e6",
                                "text": "In our ragbag of stereotypes, ostriches have thus become the quintessential dim-witted animals. Even the Bible says they're dumb, and bad parents too."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "229702f7-a603-4bca-ada2-c88ac46573a9",
                                "sense_id": "2684281f-4705-3628-9617-5b26e59631e6",
                                "text": "Opposite, the Loram site contains a real ragbag of yellow, blue or rust-streaked kit whose appearance belies their importance in keeping the railways running."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "11862290-0968-38af-805f-dd2fae107235",
                        "entry_id": "b7a56a88-db37-3dea-a464-2cf201cd6354",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person (especially a woman) of unclean or untidy appearance."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively",
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "50e19fd0-7a9f-4b28-8d7f-25a7f54a79a4",
                                "sense_id": "11862290-0968-38af-805f-dd2fae107235",
                                "text": "Near-synonym: ragtag"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d71aa78-fbc3-4f5e-ba9e-ca7f84f41387",
                                "sense_id": "11862290-0968-38af-805f-dd2fae107235",
                                "text": "Billy and the rest were wooed through gate after gate, and Billy saw his first Russian. The man was all alone in the night—a ragbag with a round, flat face that glowed like a radium dial."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
